# Third-party licences

The ZX Sidekick programs link the crates below into their binaries,
and their licences ask that their notices travel with it. This file is what
carries them.

It says nothing about the games themselves. Each is its rights holders',
this project contains no part of any, and each program runs the player's
own copy, unchanged. Each game's README says where to get one.

The programs link one more thing that is not a crate: ZX Sidekick for Manic
Miner includes the ZX Spectrum ROM's character set, the 768 bytes the game
prints its text with, © Amstrad plc. Amstrad have kindly given their
permission for the redistribution of their copyrighted material but retain
that copyright. The permission covers emulators.

